      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef batches(items, size):\n    return [items[i:i + size] for i in range(0, len(items), size)]\n\n\nids = list(range(1, 11))\nfor part in batches(ids, 4):\n    print(part)\nprint(len(batches(list(range(1000)), 128)))\n```",
